  "body_html": "<h1>Nash Payoffs Are Individually Rational</h1>\n<p>In a finite strategic game, the payoff vector of any Nash equilibrium belongs to\n$R_1$, the set of feasible and individually rational payoffs.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Section 4.10.1] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>. Any Nash equilibrium belongs to R_1.</li>\n</ul>",
